  "description": "OpenAI-compatible hosted inference server over CircleAI.Hosting.InferenceBridge. Endpoints: /v1/chat/completions (SSE streaming), /v1/embeddings, /v1/companion/*, /v1/diagnostics, /v1/healthz, /v1/readyz. JWT and API-key auth out of the box. Ships Dockerfile, systemd unit, and a Windows-service install script. 1.3.6 picks up CircleAI.Inference 1.3.6 — adds linux-arm64 (Raspberry Pi 4/5, AWS Graviton, Apple-Silicon-via-Linux-VM, ARM-based cloud VMs). Server now runs on 5 host platforms: win-x64, linux-x64, linux-arm64, osx-arm64, osx-x64.",
